*> vybe-test: cobol/qualified_names_of_clause/qualified_two_records_same_subfield
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_qualified_names_of_clause.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 EMP-A.
   05 NAME PIC X(8) VALUE "ALICE   ".
   05 DEPT PIC X(3) VALUE "IT".
01 EMP-B.
   05 NAME PIC X(8) VALUE "BOB     ".
   05 DEPT PIC X(3) VALUE "HR".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY NAME OF EMP-A.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING NAME OF EMP-A DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "ALICE   "
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [ALICE   ] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY DEPT OF EMP-B.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING DEPT OF EMP-B DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "HR "
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [HR ] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

